notes=The authors publish ld1.x input decks rather than finished files, and PseudoForge ships all 28 of them (14 elements, scalar and fully-relativistic). Generation is therefore a real reproduction with the same engine used for PSlibrary, and it works offline. This set covers Z=90-103, where PSlibrary stops at Pu.
